  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Cannes has several hotels welcoming dogs along the Croisette and in the Suquet district, from high-end to more affordable chains. Some luxury establishments even offer dedicated equipment (baskets, bowls) for stays with a dog.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Conditions and surcharges vary a lot between a 5-star hotel on the Croisette and a simpler address in the town centre — a direct call before booking remains essential.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the Lérins Islands, reachable by shuttle boat from Cannes harbour, are the must-do excursion with your dog during a stay in Cannes.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Camping La Provençale in Mandelieu-la-Napoule, a few minutes from Cannes, is a more affordable alternative that has already been checked.</p>
